      "text": "Figure 23, website of CodeAgent. The interface provides a web-based code review portal with input panels for code changes (diffs), commit messages, and repository context, alongside response panels presenting multi-agent review outputs categorized into semantic consistency, vulnerability detection, code style validation, and code revision suggestions.",
